---
title: Benchmark实验设计图
---
%% 图示说明：展示固定任务、五组对照、十轮执行、三百条记录及汇总指标的可复现实验设计。
flowchart TD
    TASKS["2 组连续任务场景<br/>企业 RAG 3个 + 企业 API 3个"]
    ROUND["每轮 6 个任务<br/>固定顺序"]
    REPEAT["重复 10 轮"]
    FIXED["固定条件<br/>Fake LLM + Fake Embedding<br/>seed 2026 · 独立临时存储"]

    subgraph MATRIX["5 个实验组"]
        direction LR
        TEXT["text"]
        STRUCT["structured"]
        NO_MEMORY["structured_<br/>no_memory"]
        NO_STATE["structured_<br/>no_semantic_state"]
        NO_REF["structured_<br/>no_result_ref"]
    end

    RECORDS["5 × 10 × 6<br/>共 300 条任务记录"]

    subgraph METRIC_GROUPS["统一指标"]
        direction LR
        QUALITY["完成率 / 错误 / 重试"]
        LATENCY["耗时<br/>P50 · P95 · 标准差"]
        COMM["字符 / Token<br/>JSON / MessagePack 字节"]
        MEMORY["记忆命中<br/>重复检索"]
        RESOURCE["资源清理<br/>SQLite · 状态文件 · 后台进程"]
    end

    OUTPUT["原始记录与汇总<br/>JSONL / CSV / JSON"]
    CONCLUSION["对照分析<br/>基线 · 完整方案 · 消融 · 稳定性"]

    TASKS --> ROUND --> REPEAT
    FIXED --> MATRIX
    REPEAT --> MATRIX
    TEXT --> RECORDS
    STRUCT --> RECORDS
    NO_MEMORY --> RECORDS
    NO_STATE --> RECORDS
    NO_REF --> RECORDS
    RECORDS --> QUALITY
    RECORDS --> LATENCY
    RECORDS --> COMM
    RECORDS --> MEMORY
    RECORDS --> RESOURCE
    QUALITY --> OUTPUT
    LATENCY --> OUTPUT
    COMM --> OUTPUT
    MEMORY --> OUTPUT
    RESOURCE --> OUTPUT
    OUTPUT --> CONCLUSION

    classDef input fill:#EAF3FF,stroke:#377DFF,color:#16325C,stroke-width:1.4px;
    classDef experiment fill:#ECFDF3,stroke:#22A06B,color:#124B35,stroke-width:1.4px;
    classDef metric fill:#FFF8E8,stroke:#E6A700,color:#594100,stroke-width:1.4px;
    classDef output fill:#F2ECFF,stroke:#7C4DFF,color:#35205F,stroke-width:1.4px;

    class TASKS,ROUND,REPEAT,FIXED input;
    class TEXT,STRUCT,NO_MEMORY,NO_STATE,NO_REF,RECORDS experiment;
    class QUALITY,LATENCY,COMM,MEMORY,RESOURCE metric;
    class OUTPUT,CONCLUSION output;
    linkStyle default stroke:#64748B,stroke-width:1.3px;
